Focuses on connecting different LLM providers through one common interface.
Uses Gemini as a cloud-based LLM provider.
Uses Ollama with the Llama 3.2 model as a local LLM provider.
Creates a common interface using Python classes.
Allows users to select either Gemini or Ollama.
Sends the same type of prompt to the selected provider.

Output: The selected LLM generates an answer and displays it in the terminal.
